<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Good morning, Keyran users!

This time around, you get a special macro for bosses (or tough fights).

First things first: you will need a strong digi. Either an SSS or SSS+. Because of this, and the fact that you will use F2 and F3, you will need DS discs, and the good ones at that.

So, a few recomendations:
1) have a digiaura
2) have a Magnetic ID
3) have a 1000x exp multiplier two times (one from the regular ones, and the other from the dungeons)
4) put the ds disc on F5

You can use this Macro for training on Rainbow Bridge, or go to a boss and leave it there, or Minato city.

Good luck!</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 1 s
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 1 s
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 1 s
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 59 1
Delay 2 s
KeyUp 59 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 62 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 62 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 5
KeyDown 60 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 60 1
Delay 1 s
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Digimon Masters Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>